Complementary error function: fdlibm
=========================================================================

The erfc() function in
engine/src/main/kotlin/io/github/valnrys/teambayes/engine/NormalDist.kt is a
Kotlin translation of erfc() from s_erf.c in netlib's fdlibm
(https://netlib.org/fdlibm/s_erf.c). It is used under the following notice:

