=========================================================================
Normal distribution (cdf, pdf, invCdf): CPython
=========================================================================

The cdf(), pdf() and invCdf() functions in
engine/src/main/kotlin/io/github/valnrys/teambayes/engine/NormalDist.kt follow
CPython 3.14's Lib/statistics.py (https://github.com/python/cpython): cdf() and
pdf() copy the formulas of NormalDist.cdf and NormalDist.pdf, and invCdf() is a
translation of _normal_dist_inv_cdf(), which implements Wichura's algorithm
AS241.

Copyright (c) 2001 Python Software Foundation; All Rights Reserved

Summary of changes: translated from Python to Kotlin, with the mean fixed at
0 and the standard deviation at 1. The formulas, constants and order of
operations are unchanged.

